 "text": "Hi, how you doing these days? Try getting up every hour or so with a short walk around office. Lots of small breaks are much better than long one every few hours. Then a little stand under each arm helps. They' worth the space they take. Best to take short break every hour to sit up straight anyway. A few minutes of stretching can help too. That's normal. Lots of people do. A chair with a back that rotates forward a bit helps. It allows you to sit up taller.",
